# Personal documents — never commit
HANDOFF.md
**/HANDOFF.md
project-state.md
**/project-state.md
*proposal*
*PROPOSAL*
*.proposal.md

# Local project memory — per-user, not shared
memory/

# Gate flags — per session
.gates/

# Session state — per session, managed by hooks only
.session/

# Scratch dir — agents write findings.json here for hooks/finalize_report.py
.scratch/

# Agent-toolkit local config — machine-specific, regenerated by bootstrap
.agent-toolkit/config.json

# Signed gate — private key never commit; token refreshed by CI
.gate/signing.key
.gate/private.pem
.gate/gate-token.jwt
.gate/attestation.json
.gate/signing.meta.json

# Role knowledge — only synthesis files are needed at runtime
# Intermediate extractions can be regenerated with learn.py
roles/*/knowledge/*.md
!roles/*/knowledge/_synthesis.md
roles/.learn-cache/
